BT /F1 11 Tf 72 546 Td (benefit of learning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 523 Td (- Rising time per chunk is a warning sign.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 90 506 Td (- Short or skipped answers suggest overload.) Tj ET
