BT /F1 11 Tf 72 680 Td (following session.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 72 649 Td (What to record) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 629 Td (Useful records include the number of chunks completed, the time spent, the checkpoints) Tj ET
